From b877b7cad4b850327ebcc8166afe46bb95b9cb5a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: huzhaolun <huzhaolun@qq.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 17:42:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 08/11] fix(discovery): accept plain http endpoints and warn
 about them

The URL was rejected unless it started with https://, which broke self-hosted
endpoints on http (including localhost). Both schemes are now accepted, and a
warning appears under the field while a plain http address is typed.
